    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63362" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐν-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pertaining to flax</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόρος</span>”
				<i>flax-tax,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					PBaden
					19.32
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>made of flax</i> or <i>linen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Steril.</u>
				221
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.34
			</span></i>. (Perh. always a misspelling of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίνεος</span>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίναια
				&lt;:ἔρια&gt;</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> is a misspelling of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λήνεα</span>.)</div>
